commit d19ca0a8d9f82c130b7ed339b9f033433e2dea5e
Author: Steffen Deusch <steffen@deusch.me>
Date:   Tue Jul 7 11:29:58 2026 +0200

    Limit the number of channels a single transport process can join
    
    This prevents a single client from opening an unbounded number of
    channels (processes).

